<view class="page archive">
  <view class="head fade-up">
    <text class="eyebrow">VOICE ARCHIVE</text>
    <view class="title serif">录音档案</view>
    <view class="head-sub">共 {{items.length}} 条，最多保留 15 条。回听时，先听停顿和收尾。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="archive-list">
    <view
      wx:for="{{items}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="archive-card fade-up"
      data-report="{{item.reportId}}"
      bindtap="openReport"
    >
      <view class="between archive-top">
        <view class="archive-date">{{item.dateText}}</view>
        <view class="archive-score serif">{{item.score}}<text> 分</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="archive-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="archive-meta">{{item.categoryName}} · {{item.durationText}}</view>

      <view class="archive-actions">
        <view class="play-pill" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="togglePlay">
          <view class="play-dot {{playingId === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}"></view>
          <text>{{playingId === item.id ? '暂停' : '回听'}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="archive-remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="remove">删除</view>
        <view class="grow"></view>
        <view class="archive-report">看点评 →</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <empty-state
    wx:else
    mark="录"
    title="还没有录音"
    desc="完成一次练习后，录音会自动存到这里。录音只保存在本机。"
    action="去练一次"
    bind:action="goPractice"
  />

  <view wx:if="{{items.length}}" class="archive-note">
    录音文件保存在微信本地目录，清理微信缓存或卸载小程序后可能丢失。重要的录音请及时回听。
  </view>
</view>
